$MDESC::Type = "VIP";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> VIP Assassination" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Wasteland IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Sand Storm, Limited Visibility" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	 "\n<f1>Max Bases: <f0> 2/5" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Two dropships from the <$vserver::teamname0> and <$vserver::teamname1> teams have had a long standing grudge.  Finally the two opposing captains and crews have had enough and are intent on settling their dispute once and for all.  The two dropship crews have dropped onto the neutral planet of Wasteland IV.  Here they will battle it out by selecting one of four dropships and making their stand within.  Because all four dropships are extremely defensible, attackers may have to use guile and trickery to lure the enemy Captain out to his ship's command bridge in order to strike!\n\nDefend your Dropship Captain, while attempting to kill the enemy Dropship Captain.  The first team to successfully assassinate the enemy Captain shall be declared the victor!";

